menu "mdns_manager"

    config MDNS_MANAGER_MAX_SERVICES
        int "Maximum advertised services"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
            Services are copied into a statically sized table so they survive to
            be re-advertised after a reconnect, and so a caller may register from
            a stack frame. This costs memory whether or not it is used.

endmenu
